# AnyMCP

> A catalog of MCP servers. Each server is one C# file. Download the file, then point your MCP
> client to `dotnet run <file>.cs -v q`. There is no project file, no build step of your own, and
> no container. The .NET 10 SDK is the only requirement.

- Read {{ site.url }}/install.md one time. The steps are the same for each server.
- Each server has a page for a machine. Get the `.md` page, and not the HTML page.
- The full catalog as JSON: {{ site.url }}/servers.json

